      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you do not start taking tramadol without consulting your doctor first. Combining sertraline and tramadol can potentially increase the risk of serotonin syndrome, which is a serious condition. Please call your prescribing physician or pharmacist to discuss your back pain and ask them to guide you on the safest pain management options. They can assess your specific situation before recommending any medication.",
